government_projects.description:
Mba-Cardoso connects Baale Street in the north and Apapa Oworonshoki Expressway in the south. It serves as a major bye-pass between Owonronsoki Exp. Way and Boundary, Ajegunle to Lagos-Island/Mainland.                   
Total Length of Road - 3450m
Average Road Width - 10m

The proposed road  amongst others:
i. Serve as a strategic / major by-pass between Apapa–Oworonshoki Expressway and Boundary, Ajegunle to Lagos Island / Mainland;
ii. Abate the perennial flooding and erosion problem experienced within the community;
iii. Increase property value within the area;
iv. Reduce maintenance and operating costs of vehicles;
v. Create direct and indirect employment;
vi. Improve the socio-economic activities within the Local Government Area.
